<title>HONG KONG: China Overseas buys Ho Man Tin site -govt.</title>
<headline>China Overseas buys Ho Man Tin site -govt.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Overseas Land and Investment Ltd was the purchaser of the Ho Man Tin site at the government land auction on Tuesday, chief estate officer Paul Tam said.  </p>
<p>The 2,627 square metre site in central Kowloon sold for HK$1.4 billion, higher than industry analysts' forecasts of HK$848 million to HK$1.27 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
